pan></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">יִזַּח</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">יְנֻתַּק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">יִתְפָּרֵק</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מה כתוב במקום '</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וַיְסַיֵּם'?</span></span></li><ol><li><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">וַיִגְמֹר</span></span></span></li><li><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">וַיִתֹּם</span></span></span></li><li><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">וַיַעֲצֹר</span></span></span></li><li><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">וַיְכַל</span></span></span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מה כתוב במקום 'בְּסִיסוֹ'?</span></span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">כַּנּוֹ</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מוֹשָׁבוֹ</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מַעֲמָדוֹ</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">יְסוֹדוֹ</span></span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">היכן נמצאים 'שולי המעיל'?</span></li><ol><li><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">בשרוול</span></span></li><li><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weig